	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Pręstantissime <persName ref="p495">Bul[l]ingere</persName>, S. in Domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Binas abs te accepi literas eodem tempore, quibus tu mihi cumulate <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>respondes ad ea omnia, quę a te ipso flagitaram; in quo quantum tibi debeam, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>exploratissimum mihi est.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Habebo enim gratias, quoad vixero, quid vero re<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tribuam, nescio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Ego in istis comitiis, quę apud <placeName ref="l648">Rhetos</placeName> nuper sunt acta, nihil impetrare <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>potui pręter literas commendatitias scriptas omnium nomine; quod ni quorundam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>impietas obstitisset, procuratorias etiam obtinuissem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Fędus cum <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>iniverunt; adfuit <persName ref="p18538">Cęsaris</persName> orator, sed nihil profecit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Multi verentur, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ne propter id aliquę oriantur turbę.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Dominus servet suos ab impiorum sęvitia.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Hoc tantum miror, quod dominus <persName ref="p8049">Vadianus</persName>, posteaquam <placeName ref="l473">Sangallum</placeName> rediit, nihil <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>mihi rescripserit; debebat id omnino facere saltim propter suam humanitatem.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Si illa exemplaria, quę <placeName ref="l167">Geneva</placeName> isthuc ad <persName ref="p4851">F[r]oscoverum</persName> transmitti <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>debebant, translata fuerint, mirifice cupio, uti sępe ad te scripsi, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ea transmitti, quam primum poterint, <placeName ref="l93">Clavennam</placeName> usque ad doctorem <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName>Augustinum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">has vero <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> deferri curabis.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale meque in <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Domino diligas ac rogabis eum pro mea omniumque fratrum salute.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Datum <placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName>, 22. iulii 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Tui semper observantissimus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName ref="p152">Balthasar Alterius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
